{
    "title": "Gin Rummy: Card Game Online",
    "description": "<b>The Fun, The Addictive, The Free Classic Gin Rummy Game - one of the best 2 player games online or offline!\r\nInstall our Gin Rummy app and discover one of the best classic gin experiences, a great game for friends and social gatherings!</b>\r\n\r\n\u2665 This exciting free cards game is available to play anytime you want, against challenging, yet friendly and smart AI opponents. We've listened to our Gin Rummy players and added the Multiplayer game online function for you to test your offline Gin Rummy skills against players from all over the world.\u2665\r\n\r\nThe classic Gin Rummy app brings you:\r\n\u2663 The perfect, addictive card game online preferred by players worldwide\r\n\u2663 An easy to use, fun, free gin rummy app\r\n\u2663 The authentic classic gin rummy free experience you know and love from playing offline\r\n\u2663 The best mind card game and memory game to test your skills and enjoy during breaks, weekends or Holidays!\r\n\r\n<b>Looking for a traditional, addictive 2 players card game to add some fun, positive vibes to your day? If you like playing canasta, bridge games, hearts, tonk or even solitaire card games, we invite you to download our free Gin Rummy app. Discover playing in single mode or against friends, from the Lobby!</b>\r\n\r\nInstalling the best gin card game online will test your best rummy strategy - approach it like a pro and have fun organising your deck of cards. Match your card melds and runs in no time! New to classic Gin Rummy? No worries! You\u2019ll soon be \u201cknocking\u201d your opponent with a grand gin move, even if playing gin rummy at beginner level, as you\u2019ll be discreetly guided throughout your learning \"how to play\" process.\r\n\r\nKeep your options open - you have 3 gin rummy modes to try out  - the best Classic, Oklahoma and Quick gin rummy:\r\n<b>\u2666 Classic Gin Rummy</b> - the well known free classic gin rummy game. Complete your hands out of most or all of your cards to have less deadwood than your opponent.\r\n<b>\u2666 Oklahoma Gin Rummy</b> - a popular fun variation of the classic gin rummy in which players need 200 points to win. The amount of deadwood needed to knock is determined by the 1st face-up card dealt.\r\n<b>\u2666 Quick Gin Rummy</b> - when you feel like taking the risk and attempt a quick win from a single online game round, go for this version of the gin card game.\r\n\r\nNewPub\u2019s Gin Rummy app is offering you the realistic game of rummy, plus extra cool game features to enhance your experience:\r\n- Play for free - all gin rummy game experience is 100% Free\r\n- No annoying additional in-app items to disrupt gameplay\r\n- A cool Multiplayer game option that allows you to compete against gin players from other countries\r\n- Authentic Gin Rummy cards game, online edition\r\n- Beautifully illustrated graphics capturing the gin rummy experience and free customization of the game table and card themes\r\n- Auto-save option: Freely stop the rummy game at anytime and continue whenever it\u2019s best for you\r\n- Easy access to your best game scores, statistics and progress\r\n- Pleasant background music for enhanced relaxation while you play\r\n- Drag & drop or tap to move your deck cards easily around when forming your melds and runs\r\n- No Internet connection? No worries. You do not need wifi or internet connection to play this cool gin rummy app. \r\n- Communicate with other players through fun emojis, showing your excitement for the game \r\n\r\n\u2660\ufe0f\u2665\ufe0f\u2666\ufe0f\u2663\ufe0f\r\nPractice gin every day, master this addictive free mind game, relax and have fun! While at it, share this gin rummy app with your friends so that you can enjoy together its user-friendly game interface, easy-to-read cards, and more cool game features that will make you come back for more.\r\n\u2660\ufe0f\u2665\ufe0f\u2666\ufe0f\u2663\ufe0f\r\nEnjoy the BEST Gin Rummy game experience on mobile! Play this classic cards game and leave your feedback and a cool star rating, it will help us make Gin Rummy the best app for you and your friends!",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>The Fun, The Addictive, The Free Classic Gin Rummy Game - one of the best 2 player games online or offline!<br>Install our Gin Rummy app and discover one of the best classic gin experiences, a great game for friends and social gatherings!</b><br><br>\u2665 This exciting free cards game is available to play anytime you want, against challenging, yet friendly and smart AI opponents. We&#39;ve listened to our Gin Rummy players and added the Multiplayer game online function for you to test your offline Gin Rummy skills against players from all over the world.\u2665<br><br>The classic Gin Rummy app brings you:<br>\u2663 The perfect, addictive card game online preferred by players worldwide<br>\u2663 An easy to use, fun, free gin rummy app<br>\u2663 The authentic classic gin rummy free experience you know and love from playing offline<br>\u2663 The best mind card game and memory game to test your skills and enjoy during breaks, weekends or Holidays!<br><br><b>Looking for a traditional, addictive 2 players card game to add some fun, positive vibes to your day? If you like playing canasta, bridge games, hearts, tonk or even solitaire card games, we invite you to download our free Gin Rummy app. Discover playing in single mode or against friends, from the Lobby!</b><br><br>Installing the best gin card game online will test your best rummy strategy - approach it like a pro and have fun organising your deck of cards. Match your card melds and runs in no time! New to classic Gin Rummy? No worries! You\u2019ll soon be \u201cknocking\u201d your opponent with a grand gin move, even if playing gin rummy at beginner level, as you\u2019ll be discreetly guided throughout your learning &quot;how to play&quot; process.<br><br>Keep your options open - you have 3 gin rummy modes to try out  - the best Classic, Oklahoma and Quick gin rummy:<br><b>\u2666 Classic Gin Rummy</b> - the well known free classic gin rummy game. Complete your hands out of most or all of your cards to have less deadwood than your opponent.<br><b>\u2666 Oklahoma Gin Rummy</b> - a popular fun variation of the classic gin rummy in which players need 200 points to win. The amount of deadwood needed to knock is determined by the 1st face-up card dealt.<br><b>\u2666 Quick Gin Rummy</b> - when you feel like taking the risk and attempt a quick win from a single online game round, go for this version of the gin card game.<br><br>NewPub\u2019s Gin Rummy app is offering you the realistic game of rummy, plus extra cool game features to enhance your experience:<br>- Play for free - all gin rummy game experience is 100% Free<br>- No annoying additional in-app items to disrupt gameplay<br>- A cool Multiplayer game option that allows you to compete against gin players from other countries<br>- Authentic Gin Rummy cards game, online edition<br>- Beautifully illustrated graphics capturing the gin rummy experience and free customization of the game table and card themes<br>- Auto-save option: Freely stop the rummy game at anytime and continue whenever it\u2019s best for you<br>- Easy access to your best game scores, statistics and progress<br>- Pleasant background music for enhanced relaxation while you play<br>- Drag &amp; drop or tap to move your deck cards easily around when forming your melds and runs<br>- No Internet connection? No worries. You do not need wifi or internet connection to play this cool gin rummy app. <br>- Communicate with other players through fun emojis, showing your excitement for the game <br><br>\u2660\ufe0f\u2665\ufe0f\u2666\ufe0f\u2663\ufe0f<br>Practice gin every day, master this addictive free mind game, relax and have fun! While at it, share this gin rummy app with your friends so that you can enjoy together its user-friendly game interface, easy-to-read cards, and more cool game features that will make you come back for more.<br>\u2660\ufe0f\u2665\ufe0f\u2666\ufe0f\u2663\ufe0f<br>Enjoy the BEST Gin Rummy game experience on mobile! Play this classic cards game and leave your feedback and a cool star rating, it will help us make Gin Rummy the best app for you and your friends!",
